  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your fiery spells are infused with deadly cosmic energies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Atomic Spell<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add one-half your mythic tier to the save DC of the wasting disease brought on by your atomic spells. If you expend one use of your mythic power, the disease is contagious as though you had cast mythic contagion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
